            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Selene.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon where nothing ever goes quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Elara</strong>, a young maintenance technician living in a quiet lunar greenhouse… until a mysterious signal pulls her into a journey through alien ruins, forgotten temples, and secrets far above her pay grade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with <strong>Luma</strong>, a mysterious luminous companion, you will explore hostile biomes, confront ancient threats, and uncover what the Solyani sealed deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because something is about to awaken.<br>And it doesn’t seem particularly friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Dynamic combat</strong> with dodging, abilities, and Luma’s active support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Environmental puzzles and platforming</strong> built around your companion’s powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>3D exploration</strong> across surreal lunar biomes, temples, and Solyani ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Side quests across Selene</strong> — help settlers, researchers, and rogue bots with problems only you can fix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Potion crafting system</strong> to survive extreme environmental conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>A sci-fi story</strong> blending mystery, light irony, and dialogue choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Rover exploration and time-attack challenges</strong> — master high-speed traversal and beat the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selene is not the moon you expected.<br>And you may not be the hero who was meant to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by One Slightly Overcaffeinated Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one developer, a keyboard, and a questionable amount of ambition.<br>If something is broken, mysterious, or unexpectedly brilliant… that’s also me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Selene.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon where nothing ever goes quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/135b4a650362fce4ea6a0d1ec80a24a1.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Elara</strong>, a young maintenance technician living in a quiet lunar greenhouse… until a mysterious signal pulls her into a journey through alien ruins, forgotten temples, and secrets far above her pay grade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c5945ae86654bcca3d86d5415a82f449.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with <strong>Luma</strong>, a mysterious luminous companion, you will explore hostile biomes, confront ancient threats, and uncover what the Solyani sealed deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because something is about to awaken.<br>And it doesn’t seem particularly friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/8932d9521390c3ebc73d5ac177e96613.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Dynamic combat</strong> with dodging, abilities, and Luma’s active support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Environmental puzzles and platforming</strong> built around your companion’s powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>3D exploration</strong> across surreal lunar biomes, temples, and Solyani ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Side quests across Selene</strong> — help settlers, researchers, and rogue bots with problems only you can fix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Potion crafting system</strong> to survive extreme environmental conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>A sci-fi story</strong> blending mystery, light irony, and dialogue choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Rover exploration and time-attack challenges</strong> — master high-speed traversal and beat the clock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selene is not the moon you expected.<br>And you may not be the hero who was meant to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c9040c739ecbbfbe80ffa0e4b998e67c.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by One Slightly Overcaffeinated Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just one developer, a keyboard, and a questionable amount of ambition.<br>If something is broken, mysterious, or unexpectedly brilliant… that’s also me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.poster.avif?t=1791810352\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.webm?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/341100/extras/c0306dd33b5f35dc9ccd7dbbd42701c6.mp4?t=1791810352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
