                        "recommendationid": "235434991",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199111480785",
                            "num_reviews": 190,
                            "playtime_forever": 843,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 843,
                            "last_played": 1789606108
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is seriously awesome! I still haven’t completed the main storyline, but it’s honestly super interesting and I’m really enjoying it so far.\n\nThe exploration is probably my favorite part, especially the temples and environmental puzzles. They gave me a lot of BOTW and TOTK vibes, and there aren’t many games that manage to capture that feeling well. The combat is fun too, and I really enjoyed experimenting with the different Luma abilities, especially the crossbow and platform.\n\nThere’s also a really good sense of progression as you explore, unlock new abilities, and reach new areas. It’s developed by a solo dev, and I can genuinely tell how much passion has gone into making such a big project like this. I highly recomend checking this out\n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1789607249,
